{
  "name": "Compare LLM answers and real costs with Straitly and Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n001-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Compare LLM answers and real costs with Straitly and Google Sheets\n\nPick the right model for a prompt by asking several at once. Submit a prompt and a list of model IDs in the form, Straitly sends it to each model, and you get every answer with its token count and real cost in USD. A judge model picks the best answer, and every run is saved to Google Sheets.\n\n### How it works\n1. The form collects the prompt and comma-separated model IDs.\n2. The list is split so each model gets its own request through Straitly.\n3. Each answer, its tokens and its cost are saved to the sheet.\n4. A judge model compares all answers and picks one.\n5. The form shows the answers, costs and the judge's pick.\n\n### Setup steps\n- [ ] Install the community node **n8n-nodes-straitly** (Settings > Community nodes)\n- [ ] Add your Straitly API key (straitly.ai) as a credential\n- [ ] Create a sheet **Runs** with columns run_at, prompt, model, answer, total_tokens, cost_usd, error\n- [ ] Set the judge model and max tokens in **Settings**\n\n### Customization\nAdd a system prompt field, save the judge reasoning to the sheet, or run a fixed prompt on a schedule.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 720
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n002-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "1. Collect the request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Collect the request\n\nThe form takes a prompt and model IDs. Settings splits the list and holds the judge model and token limit.",
        "width": 840,
        "height": 370,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n006-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "2. Ask every model",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1500,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Ask every model\n\nStraitly sends the prompt to each model. Failed models are kept with their error, and every answer is saved.",
        "width": 840,
        "height": 370,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n010-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "3. Judge and show",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2380,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Judge and show\n\nAll answers go to a judge model. The form then shows each answer with tokens, cost and the judge pick.",
        "width": 840,
        "height": 370,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n003-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Comparison form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Compare model answers",
        "formDescription": "Send one prompt to several models through Straitly and compare answers and cost.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Prompt",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Model IDs",
              "placeholder": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-1-flash, openai/gpt-6.1-sol",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        680,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n004-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "Settings-0",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.Prompt }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "Settings-1",
              "name": "models",
              "type": "array",
              "value": "={{ $json['Model IDs'].split(',').map(m => m.trim()).filter(m => m) }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "Settings-2",
              "name": "judge_model",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-1-flash"
            },
            {
              "id": "Settings-3",
              "name": "max_tokens",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 800
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        940,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n005-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "One item per model",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "models",
        "options": {
          "destinationFieldName": "model"
        }
      },
      "position": [
        1200,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n007-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Ask model",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-straitly.straitly",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "complete",
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $json.model }}"
        },
        "inputMode": "prompt",
        "prompt": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.prompt }}",
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.max_tokens }}"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "straitlyApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Straitly account"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "position": [
        1560,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n008-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Read answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "Read answer-0",
              "name": "model",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('One item per model').item.json.model }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "Read answer-1",
              "name": "answer",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.text ?? '' }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "Read answer-2",
              "name": "total_tokens",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.usage?.total_tokens ?? 0 }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "Read answer-3",
              "name": "cost_usd",
              "type": "number",
              "value": "={{ $json.usage?.cost ?? 0 }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "Read answer-4",
              "name": "error",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.error ?? '' }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        1820,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n009-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Save answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Runs"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "run_at": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "prompt": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.prompt }}",
            "model": "={{ $json.model }}",
            "answer": "={{ $json.answer }}",
            "total_tokens": "={{ $json.total_tokens }}",
            "cost_usd": "={{ $json.cost_usd }}",
            "error": "={{ $json.error }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        2080,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n011-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Collect answers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemData",
        "destinationFieldName": "answers",
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        2440,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n012-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Judge answers",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-straitly.straitly",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "chat",
        "operation": "complete",
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.judge_model }}"
        },
        "inputMode": "prompt",
        "systemPrompt": "You compare answers from different models. Judge accuracy, completeness and clarity. Reply in two short sentences and start with the winning model ID.",
        "prompt": "=Question:\n{{ $('Settings').first().json.prompt }}\n\nAnswers:\n{{ $json.answers.filter(a => a.answer).map(a => a.model + ':\\n' + a.answer).join('\\n\\n') }}",
        "options": {
          "maxTokens": 600
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "straitlyApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Straitly account"
        }
      },
      "position": [
        2700,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "n013-0000-4000-8000-000000000000",
      "name": "Show result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.form",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "completion",
        "completionTitle": "Model comparison",
        "completionMessage": "={{ $('Collect answers').first().json.answers.map(a => a.model + ' | ' + a.total_tokens + ' tokens | $' + a.cost_usd + (a.error ? ' | failed: ' + a.error : '') + '\\n' + a.answer).join('\\n\\n') }}\n\nJudge: {{ $json.text }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "position": [
        2960,
        180
      ]
    }
  ],
